<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ED L Bateman lifts half yr shr, div flat.</title>
<headline>ED L Bateman lifts half yr shr, div flat.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     36.4	  vs   22.1</p>
<p>    - headline earnings   28.0	  vs   12.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  9.0	  vs    9.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    9.99	 vs    6.08</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   29.83	 vs   11.80</p>
<p>    Tax			  6.72	 vs    3.80</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    8.45	 vs    7.96</p>
<p>    Turnover		 998.94	 vs  898.87</p>
<p>Div payable April 11</p>
<p>on register March 27</p>
<p>Full name: Edward L Bateman Limited</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said the improvement in the results of the half year over those of 1995 was welcome but not yet satisfactory. The group expects to show further improvement in the second half of the financial year subject to timing differences on profit recognition.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
